THE FINAL FRONTIER — LICENSING
==============================

This repository contains several kinds of work, and they are not offered under
the same terms. Find the section that covers what you want to use.

Only the novel prose and its planning documents are openly licensed. The songs,
the cover art, and the audio recordings are fully reserved. The build tooling is
MIT.

The plain-language summaries in this file are for orientation. Where a full
license text is linked or reproduced, that text is the operative one.


