-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2. WHAT IS NOT LICENSED HERE  —  ALL RIGHTS RESERVED
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Nothing in this file grants any right in the material below. Section 1 does not
reach it. No right to reproduce, distribute, adapt, publicly perform, or
commercially exploit it is given, and none should be inferred from its presence
in a public repository.

THE SONGS
    songs/                      lyrics and production notes

    Lyrics © 2026 Jessica Mulein. Fully copyright Jessica Mulein and Mulein
    Studios LLC. The lyrics are not open-licensed, and neither are the
    production notes, style prompts, or trilogy notes stored alongside them.

    Where the novel reproduces a passage of lyric verbatim and as lyric, that
    passage stays reserved. This carve-out is narrow on purpose: the recurring
    phrases and motifs the novel shares with the songs — "come in," "did I say
    yes," "copper and quiet," and the like — are prose under section 1, and you
    do not need separate permission to reproduce the prose that contains them.

THE COVER ART
    cover.jpg

    © 2026 Jessica Mulein. All rights reserved. Not licensed for reuse,
    including in adaptations otherwise permitted under section 1.

THE AUDIO RECORDINGS
    audiobook/                  narrated renders, auditions, assembled M4B files
    songs/auditions/

    Sound recordings ℗ 2026 Mulein Studios LLC. All rights reserved.

    Section 1 does permit you to produce your own non-commercial narration from
    the licensed prose. It does not permit any use of these recordings.

Permission for any of the above can be requested. Ask.


