-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
5. A NOTE ON AI CONTRIBUTION
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The prose in this novel was drafted by AI systems against specifications,
outlines, and editorial decisions written by Jessica Mulein, then revised under
her direction. The song lyrics are written by Jessica Mulein; their composition
and performance are AI-produced. Copyright is claimed in the human authorship:
the selection, arrangement, direction, and revision that produced these works.

This note is disclosure, not a term of license. It does not enlarge or reduce
any permission granted above.
